.SH NAME
odir\-commands \- console commands of the Onesimus Director
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The commands a console (oconsole, bconsole, a gRPC or MCP client) sends to the Onesimus Director. Words in brackets are optional, \fIa\fR | \fIb\fR means one of them, \fB...\fR a repeatable argument and \fB[,...]\fR a comma separated list. Each command also has a page of its own, for example \fBodir\-purge\fR(7) or \fBodir\-dot\-acl\fR(7) for \fB.acl\fR.
.PP
The grammar comes from the Director's command registry; \fB.grammar\fR prints it for the commands the console may run.
