.PP
\fBSynopsis\fR
.nf
show [catalog[=<catalog>]] [catalogs] [client[=<client>]] [clients] [console[=<console>]] [consoles] [director[=<director>]] [directors] [fileset[=<fileset>]] [filesets] [job[=<job>]] [jobs] [message[=<message>]] [messages] [pool[=<pool>]] [pools] [profile[=<profile>]] [profiles] [schedule[=<schedule>]] [schedules] [storage[=<storage>]] [storages] [user[=<user>]] [users] [counter[=<counter>]] [counters] [jobdefs[=<jobdefs>]] [all] [verbose]
show disabled [clients] [jobs] [schedules]
.fi
.PP
\fBDescription\fR
.PP
Prints resources of the running configuration in configuration syntax; passwords are masked. Several items may be given in one line.
.PP
